"3.2 Hakbang 2: I-optimize para sa target na hardware {#32-step-2-optimize-"
"for-target-hardware}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The ansatz was written using familiar gates, but our circuit must be "
"transpiled to make use of the basis gates that can be implemented on each "
"quantum computer. We select the least busy backend.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang ansatz ay isinulat gamit ang mga pamilyar na gate, ngunit ang ating "
"circuit ay kailangang i-transpile para magamit ang mga basis gate na "
"maipapatupad sa bawat quantum computer. Pipiliin natin ang Backend na may "
"pinakamaliit na bilang ng trabaho.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now transpile our circuit for this hardware and visualize our "
"transpiled ansatz.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari na nating i-transpile ang ating circuit para sa hardware na ito at "
"i-visualize ang ating na-transpile na ansatz.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
