# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the gates used have changed, and the qubits in our abstract "
"circuit have been mapped to differently-numbered qubits on the quantum "
"computer. We must map our Hamiltonian identically in order for our results "
"to be meaningful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pansinin na nagbago ang mga gate na ginamit, at ang mga qubit sa ating "
"abstract na circuit ay na-map na sa iba't ibang numeradong qubit sa quantum "
"computer. Kailangan nating i-map ang ating Hamiltonian nang pareho upang ang"
" ating mga resulta ay may kahulugan.\n"

